{title: Aap Jaisa Koi Meri Zindagi Me Aaye}
{artist: Nazia Hassan Qurbani}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Aap Jaisa [Em]Koi Meri,        [G]Zindagi Me [Em]Aye
To [G]Baat Ban Ja [Am]Ye,        Aha Aa [Am]Baat Ban [G]JaYe
[G]Aap Jaisa [Em]Koi Meri,        [G]Zindagi Me [Em]Aye
To [G]Baat Ban Ja [Am]Ye,        Aha Aa [Am]Baat Ban [G]JaYe
[Em]Phool Ko BaHaar,        [Em]BaHaar Ko ChaMan,
[C]Dil Ko [G]Dil,        [D]BaDan Se BaDan
[G]Har Kisiko Chahiye,        [Em]Tan-man Ka MiLan
[C]Kaash Muzhpar [Am]Aisa,        Dil [D]Aap Ka Bhi [Em]Aye
To [G]Baat Ban Ja [Am]Ye,        Aha Aa [Am]Baat Ban [G]JaYe
[Em]Me Insaan Hu,        Fa [Em]Rishta NaHi
[C]Dar Hai Behak,        Na [D]Jao KaHi
[G]Tanha Dil Na Samjhega,        [Em]Pyaar Bina Ye Khatkega
[C]Aap Sa Ka [Am]Han Hai,        Dil [D]Aap Ko Hi [Em]Paye
To [G]Baat Ban Ja [Am]Ye,        Aha Aa [Am]Baat Ban [G]JaYe
